    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game transports players into a dreamlike setting, where they use the AD keys to control a geometric block sliding down a sunset boulevard. On this endless straight path, players can fully indulge in the romantic sunset scenery, with the sky transitioning from golden yellow to deep blue, and clouds painted with soft orange-red hues, forming a beautiful picture. The game offers an incredibly smooth experience, whether it's controlling the block's movement or enjoying the scenery along the way, providing players with an unparalleled fluid sensation. The goal is to slide for as long as possible on this boulevard, but beware: the game ends if the geometric block touches the boundary of the road or collides with other stationary orange blocks. The longer the sliding duration, the better the score. This is not only a test of operational precision but also a challenge to patience and focus.</p>",
